  "worked_solution": "The recursive formula is\n\n$$\n{a}_{n+2}={a}_{n+1}+{a}_{n}.\n$$\n\nSubstituting $n=1$ into the recursive formula gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{a}_{1+2} & ={a}_{1+1}+{a}_{1} \\\\ {a}_{3} & ={a}_{2}+{a}_{1} \\\\ {a}_{3} & =3+0 \\\\ {a}_{3} & =3.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
